[*] AoU layout : dv/act Sec 8 interface-activation FSM unit test (tb_aou_act).
[*]
[*] Emphasis: the Table-24 state machine and everything that moves it.
[*]   1. state / enabled / act_disabled / error - the FSM verdict signals;
[*]   2. the Misc handshake, split tx (send_*) versus rx (rx_is_*): ActivateReq /
[*]      Ack, CrdtGrant, DeactivateReq / Ack;
[*]   3. the decoded CrdtGrant seed pulse and its five Table-17 grant codes -
[*]      the credit bank is armed exactly on seed_valid;
[*]   4. the Sec 8.3.2 Option-2 teardown gate: deact_trig -> deact_pending /
[*]      quiescing held until data_idle, and the ERROR -> err_clear recovery.
[*]
[*] wave-check: env=act
[dumpfile] "dv/act/sim_build/tb_aou_act.fst"
[timestart] 0
[sst_width] 300
[signals_width] 380
[pane_width] 1240
[treeopen] tb_aou_act.
[treeopen] tb_aou_act.dut.
[pattern_trace] 1
[pattern_trace] 0
